---
---
<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <p class="diagram-label">Rapido vs. Uber — Where Each Wins</p>

  <div class="panels-row">
    <div class="panel panel-rapido">
      <div class="panel-header">Rapido</div>

      <div class="panel-section">
        <div class="section-label wins">Wins on</div>
        <ul class="item-list">
          <li>Availability</li>
          <li>Price</li>
          <li>Speed</li>
          <li>India-native design</li>
          <li>High-frequency commutes</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="panel-section">
        <div class="section-label loses">Loses on</div>
        <ul class="item-list item-list-muted">
          <li>Safety perception</li>
          <li>Comfort</li>
          <li>Long distances</li>
          <li>Weather</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panel panel-uber">
      <div class="panel-header">Uber</div>

      <div class="panel-section">
        <div class="section-label wins">Wins on</div>
        <ul class="item-list">
          <li>Safety perception</li>
          <li>Comfort</li>
          <li>Long distances</li>
          <li>Airport runs</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="panel-section">
        <div class="section-label loses">Loses on</div>
        <ul class="item-list item-list-muted">
          <li>Price</li>
          <li>Wait times</li>
          <li>Short-trip economics</li>
          <li>Captain supply</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bottom-note">
    Rapido owns the daily commute. Uber owns the occasion. Neither needs to beat the other everywhere.
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .diagram-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .panels-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .panel {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .panel-rapido {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }
  .panel-uber {
    background: var(--color-background);
  }
  .panel-header {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: 'Cabinet Grotesk', sans-serif;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .panel-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .section-label.wins {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .section-label.loses {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }
  .item-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .item-list li {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding-left: 10px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .item-list li::before {
    content: '·';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-border);
  }
  .item-list-muted li {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
  }
  .bottom-note {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .panels-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
